WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.038
This morning my AI agent posted four times

00:00:03.938 --> 00:00:05.925
on Reddit while I was away.

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:07.825
It never asked me once.

00:00:07.862 --> 00:00:09.775
Here is why that was safe.

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:14.000
At three this morning, the agent wrote a plan:

00:00:14.025 --> 00:00:16.400
the exact page, the exact button,

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:18.375
and every word it would post.

00:00:18.462 --> 00:00:21.250
Four steps, between ten and noon.

00:00:22.725 --> 00:00:25.088
I read it once on my phone and approved it

00:00:24.988 --> 00:00:26.350
with my passkey.

00:00:26.413 --> 00:00:28.225
That was my only tap.

00:00:29.725 --> 00:00:33.000
At ten, it signed in with my saved login.

00:00:33.025 --> 00:00:35.025
It never saw the password.

00:00:35.025 --> 00:00:38.050
And from now on, my phone gets a short notice

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.300
each time a login is used.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:44.288
For each post, the vault sent a fingerprint

00:00:44.188 --> 00:00:46.500
of the text it was about to submit.

00:00:46.525 --> 00:00:49.487
It matched what I had read, so the click went

00:00:49.387 --> 00:00:50.250
through.

00:00:51.775 --> 00:00:54.350
One changed word, another page,

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:56.700
or anything with a price, and it would have

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:58.000
asked me first.

00:00:59.525 --> 00:01:02.138
Four posts, no prompts, all done by twelve

00:01:02.038 --> 00:01:03.375
past ten.

00:01:03.412 --> 00:01:05.875
Then it signed out and sent me a summary.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:07.300
Auth Your Agent.

00:01:07.362 --> 00:01:10.337
Free and open source, at auth your agent dot

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:11.150
com.
